    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61636" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾱϊκ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>from the
				people</i>: hence, <i>unofficial, civilian,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLille
				10.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				93.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>common</i> (opp. consecrated), of bread, <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thd.
				<u>1 Ki.</u>
				21.4(5)
			</span></i>; of a place, opp. <i>holy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sm.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thd.
				<u>Ez.</u>
				48.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <i>layman</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληρικός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				1.1.3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.3.38.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				6.5
			</span></i>.</div>
